      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i woke up this morning and my whole left side of my face just feels weird. like it's drooping a bit and i cant really close my eye all the way on that side. i tried looking in the mirror and it definitely looks lopsided. is this like bell's palsy or should im worried about a stroke??",
